                            <comment id="495399" author="hornc" created="Tue, 2 Jun 2026 20:03:38 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Simple reproducer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;[root@n10 tests]# git -P log --oneline -n 1
69a0a33a01 (HEAD, origin/master, origin/HEAD) LU-19385 tests: skip sanity-lnet/226 for old client
[root@n10 tests]# dd if=/dev/zero of=/mnt/lustre/f bs=4M count=4 oflag=direct
&amp;lt;trips assert on server and hangs&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With the fix:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;[root@n10 tests]# git -P log --oneline -n 1
92459af6ec (HEAD -&amp;gt; master, bugfix/master/lu-14633-o2ib-get-sink-nob) LU-20326 o2iblnd: fix GET sink buffer length for RDMA
[root@n10 tests]# dd if=/dev/zero of=/mnt/lustre/f bs=4M count=4 oflag=direct
4+0 records in
4+0 records out
16777216 bytes (17 MB, 16 MiB) copied, 0.124027 s, 135 MB/s
[root@n10 tests]# &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
